flowchart TD
  U[Brief / Source / References] --> D[Director OS Compiler]
  U --> AN[Physical Analyze Pipeline]
  AN --> FP[FeaturePack Evidence]
  FP --> VN[MotionStyle2JSON / Visual DNA]

  subgraph KG[GraphRAG Knowledge Planes]
    RM[Reference Memory]
    SM[Style Memory]
    MM[Motion Memory]
    SU[Success Memory]
    FM[Failure Memory]
    RRM[Renderer Memory]
    AM[Asset Memory]
  end

  VN --> KG
  D --> SG[Semantic Creative Graph]
  KG --> RET[Hybrid GraphRAG Retrieval]
  RET --> SG

  SG --> EG[Editing Graph]
  EG --> BG[Beat / Scene Graph]
  EG --> LG[Layer / Track Graph]
  EG --> CG[Camera / Depth / Material Graph]
  EG --> AG[Audio / Music / VO Graph]
  EG --> TG[Transition / Primitive Graph]

  subgraph PROVIDERS[Provider + Asset Intelligence]
    PIN[Pinterest Reference]
    PEX[Pexels]
    FLA[Flaticon]
    SWI[Swishy Pattern Reference]
    LOC[Local / Drive]
    GEN[Generated Assets]
  end

  PROVIDERS --> AI[License / Hash / Fitness / Provenance]
  AI --> LG

  EG --> SK[Skill DAG / Capability Resolver]
  SK --> RR[Renderer Router]

  subgraph RENDERERS[Renderer Backends]
    REM[Remotion]
    HF[HyperFrames]
    LOT[Lottie Subset]
    SVG[SVG + JS]
    VID[Generated / Raster Plates]
  end

  RR --> RENDERERS
  RENDERERS --> COMP[FFmpeg / Multi-renderer Compositor]
  COMP --> MASTER[Master Artifact]

  MASTER --> QA[Technical + Temporal + Grammar + Brand + Creative Critics]
  QA -->|pass| REL[Release + Attestation]
  QA -->|defect| DEF[Defect Graph]
  DEF --> ROOT[Root Cause]
  ROOT --> CAND[Repair Candidate Subgraphs]
  CAND --> IMP[Impact / Descendant Analysis]
  IMP --> SK
  REL --> SU
  DEF --> FM
  REL --> RRM

  subgraph LEVELS[Three-level invariant]
    L1[L1 Semantic Intent]
    L2[L2 Editing / Motion]
    L3[L3 Render / Evidence]
    L1 --> L2 --> L3
  end
